<%# One-click switch between the two home compositions (Roadmap V3 §1.14).
    It writes the active profile's stored preference, so there is a single
    source of truth and the choice survives the next visit — the same value the
    profile form edits. It gates nothing: both modes reach every feature.

    Rendered as the theme's `.mf-mode-switch`, whose selected option paints
    itself with the mode accent — so the control shows which mode you are in
    rather than only naming it.

    The two options sit on one line with the short labels ("Aprendo" /
    "Enseño"), founder direction 2026-09-10: the full first-person phrases do
    not fit side by side in the panel, and stacked they read as two nav links
    rather than one choice. The short forms are still first-person verbs, which
    is what Roadmap V3 §1.14 asked of the naming; the full phrase stays as the
    tooltip, and the profile form keeps using it next to its help text.

    It lives under the brand in the side panel, not on the home: the mode now
    reskins the whole signed-in app, so the switch belongs with the app chrome
    and has to be reachable from any page. `returnTo` is therefore the current
    page rather than `/`, so switching repaints where you are instead of
    sending you home.

    `compact: true` renders icons only, for the mobile toolbar where two labels
    do not fit beside the menu and translator buttons. The full phrase then
    becomes the `aria-label` — `title` alone is not an accessible name on a
    touch screen. %>
<% const compact = Boolean(locals.compact); %>
<form
  class="mf-mode-switch home-mode-switch<%= compact ? ' mf-mode-switch--icons' : '' %>"
  method="post"
  action="/home/mode"
  aria-label="<%= t('home.modeAria') %>"
>
  <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
  <input type="hidden" name="returnTo" value="<%= currentPath %>">
  <% const activeHomeMode = activeProfile ? activeProfile.homeMode : 'learn'; %>
  <button
    type="submit"
    name="homeMode"
    value="learn"
    title="<%= t('home.modeLearn') %>"
    <% if (compact) { %>aria-label="<%= t('home.modeLearn') %>"<% } %>
    <%= activeHomeMode === 'learn' ? 'aria-current="page"' : '' %>
  >
    <i class="bi bi-mortarboard" aria-hidden="true"></i><% if (!compact) { %><%= t('home.modeLearnShort') %><% } %>
  </button>
  <button
    type="submit"
    name="homeMode"
    value="teach"
    title="<%= t('home.modeTeach') %>"
    <% if (compact) { %>aria-label="<%= t('home.modeTeach') %>"<% } %>
    <%= activeHomeMode === 'teach' ? 'aria-current="page"' : '' %>
  >
    <i class="bi bi-easel" aria-hidden="true"></i><% if (!compact) { %><%= t('home.modeTeachShort') %><% } %>
  </button>
</form>
